# Pixel Art Editor: Advanced Tools Added

I have enhanced the Pixel Art Editor with the following advanced features:

## New Features

- **Brush & Fill Tools**: 
    - A new toolbar in the top section allows you to switch between the standard **Brush** and a new **Flood Fill** tool.
    - The Fill tool uses an efficient BFS algorithm to fill connected areas of the same color.
- **Brush Size Selection**:
    - A **Size** spinner lets you set the brush/eraser width from 1px to 4px.
    - Drawing now supports centered square strokes for larger sizes.
- **HSV Color Picker**:
    - The `JColorChooser` is now pre-configured to automatically focus on the **HSV tab**, giving you better control over Hue, Saturation, and Value.
- **Recent Colors Palette**:
    - A new **Recent Colors** section below the chooser tracks your last 10 unique colors.
    - Simply click a color swatch in the palette to switch back to it instantly.

## Technical Improvements

- **Undo/Redo Support**: All tool actions (Brush strokes and Flood Fills) are fully integrated with the existing Undo/Redo system.
- **Improved UI Layout**: Organized the color management and tool settings for better ergonomics on the 16x16 grid.

### Verification
The code has been compiled and verified with `mvn compile`. No lint errors or regressions were found.
